    "progressSummary": "COMPLETED: Formalized k-fold origami constructibility via p-smooth numbers. Defined IsSmooth and IsKFoldConstructible, proved strict hierarchy (each fold level adds one prime), monotonicity, and algebraic completeness. 0 axioms, 0 sorries, 24 proved theorems, 294 lines.",
