      "Created proofs/Proofs/AngleTrisectionOQ05OQ01.lean (294 lines)",
      "IsSmooth predicate with closure properties (one_smooth, prime_smooth, smooth_mul)",
      "IsKFoldConstructible via foldPrimeBound = Nat.nth Prime",
      "Strict hierarchy witnesses at k=1→2, 2→3, 3→4",
      "constructible_mono: k-fold ⊆ (k+1)-fold",
      "eventually_constructible: algebraic completeness",
      "Composite degree classification: 6, 9, 10, 30, 42",
      "Gallery entry with meta.json, annotations.json, index.ts"
    ],
    "insights": [
      "Nat.nth Prime from Mathlib provides clean prime enumeration with nth_prime_one_eq_three etc.",
      "nth_strictMono Nat.infinite_setOf_prime gives monotonicity of prime bounds",
      "add_two_le_nth_prime is the key lemma for algebraic completeness: p_n ≥ n+2",
      "interval_cases + decide is effective for small prime divisor checking",
      "The conjecture for k ≥ 3 is genuinely open in mathematical literature"
    ],
